sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Task Low (Prio 1)
    participant M as Task Medium (Prio 2)
    participant H as Task High (Prio 3)
    participant S as Binary Semaphore (Shared Resource)

    Note over L,S: Run A: Unbounded / Bounded Priority Inversion
    L->>S: xSemaphoreTake(xSem, portMAX_DELAY) [Acquires Resource]
    L->>L: Begins critical workload (PA1 High)
    Note over H: Event triggers Task High
    H-->>L: Preempts Low (Prio 3 > Prio 1)
    H->>H: Starts execution (PA3 High)
    H->>S: xSemaphoreTake(xSem, portMAX_DELAY)
    Note over H,S: Resource is held by Low! High enters BLOCKED state
    S-->>H: Blocked
    Note over L: CPU returns to Task Low
    L->>L: Resumes critical workload (PA1 High)
    Note over M: Task Medium becomes Ready (Prio 2)
    M-->>L: Preempts Low (Prio 2 > Prio 1)
    Note over M: Task Medium DOES NOT need resource S
    M->>M: Executes 20 ms interference workload (PA2 High)
    Note over H: Task High remains BLOCKED, starved by Medium!
    M->>M: Finishes computation (PA2 Low)
    Note over L: CPU returns to Task Low
    L->>L: Completes remaining critical workload
    L->>S: xSemaphoreGive(xSem) [Releases Resource]
    L->>L: (PA1 Low)
    S-->>H: Unblocks Task High
    H->>S: Takes Resource
    H->>H: Executes critical section and completes (PA3 Low)
